OL,3,GNEWSA'Women-hater' targeted female
OL,4,Atrain passengers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "women-hater" who attacked and
OL,7,Fdrunkenly racially abused lone female
OL,8,Fpassengers on a train has been given a
OL,9,Fsuspended sentence.
OL,11,FAndre Langley, 32, kicked, elbowed and
OL,12,Fhurled abuse at one woman and punched
OL,13,Fand insulted an elderly passenger
OL,14,Fduring his "disgusting" tirade on the
OL,15,Ftrain between Darlington and Leeds,
OL,16,FTeesside Crown Court heard.
OL,18,FBoth victims said they no longer felt
OL,19,Fsafe using public transport, especially
OL,20,Ftrains, while Judge Amanda Rippon said
OL,21,FLangley deliberately targeted women.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
